  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "The Avians have perpetrated a wonderful deception. The rumour that the corpses of their gods - their gods! - rest in their tombs has spread throughout the universe. Such rumours attract looters, and said looters make for a handy, never-ending source of live sacrifices, to use in their silly rituals. It is genius, even by my standards.",
    "value": "翼族人实施了一场绝妙的骗局。他们散播谣言，称其神明 -他们的神明！- 的尸骸正安息于他们的墓穴之中，此消息已传遍整个宇宙。这类谣言自然会引来掠夺者，而据说这些掠夺者，正好为他们那些愚蠢的仪式提供了一个方便且源源不断的活祭品来源。此举堪称天才，即便以我的标准来衡量亦然。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "Of course, the corpses of the Sunborn do not rest in random tombs. They are hidden away, together, in a place known to a select few. If all goes well, that information should be in my possession in due course. I would very much like to study the biology of a god.",
    "value": "当然，太阳之子的尸骸并非随意安葬在那些墓穴里。它们被一同隐匿于一处仅为少数人所知的地点。若一切顺利，我自当在适当之时掌握这一信息。我极其渴望能研习一番神明的生物学。"
  }
